OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FA chilly and bright start
OL,6,Fto Wednesday, but becoming
OL,7,Fincreasingly cloudy throughout the
OL,8,Fmorning. Most places will remain dry,
OL,9,Fwhile winds steadily strengthen,
OL,10,Fbecoming strong by the afternoon.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FWindy
OL,13,Fwith outbreaks of rain Thursday,
OL,14,Fclearing overnight. Sunny spells and
OL,15,Fshowers Friday, with showers largely
OL,16,Fbecoming confined to the coast on
OL,17,FSaturday. Mild Thursday, otherwise
OL,18,Ftemperatures around average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
